"""NexaBrowser / NexaAura Python Runner: open -> Get Started -> name -> DOB -> gender -> mobile -> password -> Save -> I agree -> SMS -> Continue -> delete used Number entry.

Use this ONLY with NexaBrowser's NexaAura > Python Runner source edition.
It controls the current WebView2 tab using the included `nexa_browser` SDK;
it does not open Chrome, Edge, or other browser windows.

Configuration popup always opens with the editable, pre-filled Website URL
(DEFAULT_WEBSITE_URL) and action wait MIN and MAX in milliseconds (default
200-500). If Tkinter is unavailable, prompts appear in the Runner's
terminal; type each response in the Runner's "Send input" box.

For authorized website testing only. This script runs once, does not bypass
CAPTCHA/challenges, and stops if target fields are ambiguous or missing. It stops after a confirmed verification-code page; it does not read or bypass verification codes.

Extension integration: reads the FIRST Number extension entry and the ONE
saved Password extension text from encrypted, local Windows CurrentUser DPAPI
files. Neither value is printed or sent anywhere except the configured page.
No browser source/bridge modification or pip package is required.

"""

